SUMMARY:Summer Vibes at Wedge Brewery
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nHello fabulous Nomads.\n\nCome out and cel
 ebrate the winding down of summer weather at Wedge Brewery in the River Ar
 ts District. We love this venue for many reasons: great atmosphere\, delic
 ious beer options\, food truck on site\, plenty of parking\, and so much m
 ore!\n\nBreak out from your home\, co-working space\, or cafe and connect 
 with fellow remote workers. Bring your friends\, significant other\, or do
 g(s) to celebrate the freedom that comes with remote working.\n\nWhen you 
 arrive\, look for our ADN signage and group of welcoming remote workers. F
 ill out a name tag to ease introductions\, engage\, and connect.\n\nThere 
 is ample parking at this venue in the lot before Wedge and if not\, just k
 eep going past it and there is parking on the other side.\n\nHope to see y
 ou there!
