SUMMARY:Fractional Professional Life
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**Fractional Executives Connect — Ashevi
 lle Entrepreneurship Week**\n\nAsheville Entrepreneurship Week is back\, a
 nd we're carving out a room built specifically for people already doing th
 e work: active fractional executives with real\, current clients.\n\nThis 
 is not an intro session on "what is fractional work"\, or a venue for thos
 e who are just launching their fractional practice. This is a gathering fo
 r those who are active practitioners. Come talk shop with peers who unders
 tand the realities of running a fractional practice: client management\, p
 ositioning\, pricing\, referral networks\, and the operational grind of ju
 ggling multiple engagements.\n\n**Who this is for:** Active fractional exe
 cutives currently serving one or more clients\, Fractional COOs\, CFOs\, C
 MOs\, CHROs\, CTOs\, CROs\, and beyond.\n\n📅 Tuesday\, September 1\n
 🕓 4:00–6:00 PM\n\nPizza\, snacks and beverages (alcoholic and non-alc
 oholic) will be available for purchase on site.\n\nSpace will be kept inte
 ntionally small to keep the conversation real. Please complete the registr
 ation form so we can understand who will be there and build programming th
 at will fit the group.\n\n**Thinking about going fractional but haven't la
 nded your first client yet?** ***Hang tight***\, we're planning a separate
  event just for the fractionally curious later this year. This gathering i
 s reserved for practitioners already in it.
