SUMMARY:AI as Your Velocity Engine: Entrepreneur Week Edition
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**AI as Your Velocity Engine: Build Your A
 I Brand & Execution Engine in 90 Minutes**\nFree Interactive Special for E
 ntrepreneurship Week!\n\n**Are you tired of AI generating generic\, corpor
 ate fluff that sounds nothing like you?**\nMost founders and early-stage e
 ntrepreneurs spend hours prompting ChatGPT\, only to get generic marketing
  copy that feels uninspired\, unvalidated\, and safe. Speeding up the crea
 tion of weak messaging isn't velocity–it's just making noise faster.\nWh
 at if you could turn your AI into a personalized **Brand & Execution Engin
 e** that produces high-converting\, perfectly styled assets in 3 minutes i
 nstead of 3 hours?\nJoin us for a special Asheville Entrepreneur Week edit
 ion of **AI Hacks & Hops**\, where we skip the passive lectures and dive s
 traight into an interactive\, hands-on sprint.\n\n**What You Will Experien
 ce**\nThis isn't a sit-and-listen presentation. It is a live "Build\, Test
 \, Battle" workshop where you will collaborate with fellow local founders 
 and leave with a working tool you can use the very next morning.\n\n**PHAS
 E 1: Build Your AI Brand Matrix**\nWe’ll guide you step-by-step through 
 setting up your personalized **AI Brand & Velocity Matrix**—a lightweigh
 t context prompt that extracts your core offer\, target audience pain poin
 ts\, tone rules\, and banned cliché words.\n\n**PHASE 2: The 15-Minute Ex
 ecution Battle**\nOnce your engine is built\, put it to the test! You and 
 a partner will race against the clock in a live challenge to launch a comp
 lete\, multi-channel mini-campaign (landing page copy\, cold outreach\, an
 d launch posts) aligned with your authentic voice.\n\n**PHASE 3: Live Stag
 e Teardowns**\nWatch live on-screen audits where we troubleshoot real foun
 der prompts to show how small adjustments lead to 10x higher output qualit
 y and speed.\n\n**What You’ll Walk Away With**\n\n1. **Your Custom AI Br
 and & Velocity Matrix:** A copy-paste system prompt ready to plug into Cha
 tGPT\, Claude\, or Gemini.\n2. **Zero-Hype AI Workflows:** A repeatable me
 thod to generate pitch emails\, launch announcements\, and value props in 
 minutes without losing your voice.\n3. **Local Founder Connections:** Real
 -time collaboration with fellow Asheville entrepreneurs facing the same sc
 aling challenges.\n\n**Who Should Attend?**\n\n* **Aspiring & Early-Stage 
 Founders** who need to execute fast without hiring an expensive marketing 
 team.\n* **Solo Operators & Small Business Owners** wanting to automate re
 petitive copy and communication tasks.\n* **Marketers & Creators** looking
  for a structured prompt architecture that goes beyond basic chatting.\n\n
 *No technical coding or paid AI subscriptions required. Free-tier accounts
  (ChatGPT\, Claude\, Gemini) work perfectly.*\n\n**What to Bring**\n\n* A 
 laptop (preferred) or tablet/smartphone.\n* A free account created on Chat
 GPT\, Claude\, or Gemini.\n* Optional: A buddy or co-founder! (If you don'
 t have a laptop\, we will pair you up).\n\n**Event Agenda**\n5:30 PM – 6
 :00 PM: Networking\, Drinks & Setup\n6:00 PM – 7:30 PM: Interactive Work
 shop (Build\, Test\, Battle)\n7:30 PM – 8:00 PM: Wrap-Up\, Q&A & Communi
 ty Socializing\n\n**Special discount on ADN engraved Pirani cups!**\nYour 
 paid ticket gets you $10 off our 5th anniversary with our customized [ADN 
 Pirani cups](https://avldigitalnomads.org/meet-our-brand-new-customized-ad
 n-pirani-mugs/)! Available in 16oz\, 26oz\, and 32oz sizes\, you can selec
 t yours directly at this event.\n\n**General Event Info**\nAI Hacks and Ho
 ps is a monthly event tailored for non-technical professionals\, entrepren
 eurs\, marketers\, engineers\, or anyone who wants to explore and discuss 
 how to use AI.\n\nEach gathering will feature presentations\, stimulating 
 group discussions\, and a relaxed atmosphere for enjoying your favorite br
 ews while delving into the world of AI. Topics will range from AI integrat
 ion in business processes\, marketing\, content creation\, software\, ethi
 cal considerations\, human-AI collaboration strategies\, to the latest adv
 ancements in AI technology. The informal setting encourages open dialogue\
 , idea exchange\, and fosters a collaborative spirit.\n\nThe AVL Digital N
 omads are excited to be part of Asheville Entrepreneurship Week\, organize
 d by Venture Asheville. [Click here to learn how to participate in the wee
 k's activities](https://ventureasheville.com/aew/) from Aug. 31st to Sept.
  4th. There will be many opportunities to network\, mingle\, and learn abo
 ut the Asheville entrepreneurial ecosystem.
