SUMMARY:Celebrating Asheville Entrepreneurship Week
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nJoin us at **Visuals Rooftop Bar**\, locat
 ed next to Burial Beer Co. and directly above Good Hot Fish and Eulogy\, *
 *to celebrate Asheville Entrepreneurship Week!**\n\nAs remote and independ
 ent professionals\, we're a key component in driving local economic growth
 . The AVL Digital Nomads are excited to be part of Asheville Entrepreneurs
 hip Week\, organized by Venture Asheville. Our mission? Connecting remote 
 workers to the local business community – and nobody socializes in Ashev
 ille quite like us!\n\nAnd [click here to learn how to participate in the 
 week's activities](https://ventureasheville.com/aew/) from Aug. 31st to Se
 pt. 4th. There will be many opportunities to network\, mingle\, and learn 
 about the Asheville entrepreneurial ecosystem.\n\n**What to Expect:**\n\n*
  Networking opportunities with local businesses and fellow remote workers\
 n* A chance to showcase the awesome AVL Digital Nomads community\n* Our si
 gnature name tags to ease introductions\n* Alcoholic and non-alcoholic dri
 nk options\n* **Everyone is welcome!**\n\nWe look forward to celebrating w
 ith and meeting you!\n\nFYI: Eulogy right below us will have a concert tha
 t night at 8:00\, [The Builders and The Butchers w/ Johanna Rose & The Dre
 amboats.](https://dice.fm/partner/tickets/event/bb82rx-the-builders-and-th
 e-butchers-w-johanna-rose-the-dreamboats-3rd-sep-eulogy-asheville-tickets?
 dice_id=8561989&dice_channel=web&dice_tags=organic&dice_campaign=Burial+Be
 er+Company+LLC+dba+Burial+Beer+Co&dice_feature=mio_marketing&_branch_match
 _id=1575944410041265209&_branch_referrer=H4sIAAAAAAAAA8soKSkottLXz8nMy9ZLy
 UxO1UvL1fexNLYwTDUxNjVJNrKvK0pNSy0qysxLj08qyi8vTi2ydc4oys9NBQACLKGUOwAAAA%
 3D%3D)
